# Entrypoints e config

## Arquivos

- `src/config.py` — paths (`DATA_DIR`, `DB_PATH`), bbox Centro-Oeste, `FIRMS_MAP_KEY`, `OFFLINE_MODE`, `API_URL`
- `requirements.txt` — fastapi, uvicorn, sqlalchemy, pandas, lightgbm, streamlit, folium, pytest, python-dotenv
- `src/.env.example` — template sem secrets (copiar para `.env` na raiz)

## Execucao local

```bash
# API
uvicorn src.api.main:app --reload

# Dashboard (outro terminal)
streamlit run src/dashboard/app.py

# Ingestao manual
python -m src.infrastructure.firms.ingest
python -m src.infrastructure.weather.ingest
```

## Diretorios

- `data/raw/` — dados brutos FIRMS e clima
- `data/processed/` — grade, features, labels
- `data/models/` — modelo LightGBM e metricas
- `data/seed/` — demo offline
- `test/unit/`, `test/integration/` — pytest

## Regras

- Novo path persistente → `config.py` + documentar no README.
- Executar da raiz do repo.

